tate="open" id="radix-:rf:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-width: 1027.21875px; --radix-accordion-content-height: 604px;"><div class="prose px-4 pb-8"><p>If you’re an international student currently studying VCE in Australia, <a href="https://vtac.edu.au/">apply through VTAC</a>. If not, <a href="/link/10824d0d12ea4f57b870ef14178aad8b.aspx">find out how to apply directly to Federation University.</a></p><p>If you’re applying for a higher degree by research, make sure you <a href="/link/6efc37a41dd7457187d53a39c3475ba6.aspx">follow these instructions</a>.</p><p>Ready to fill out your application? You might need these codes:</p> <dl><dt><abbr title="Victorian Tertiary Admissions Centre">VTAC</abbr> application</dt><dd>Yes</dd><dt><abbr title="Victorian Tertiary Admissions Centre">VTAC</abbr> code</dt><dd>3700512103 - Mt Helen (on campus)</dd><dt>Direct application</dt><dd>Yes</dd><dt>Federation University code</dt><dd>EN8</dd><dt><abbr title="Commonwealth Register of Institutions and Courses for Overseas Students">CRICOS</abbr> code</dt><dd>116397K</dd></dl></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div class="border-b border-neutral-300" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><p class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" style="font-weight:bold;"></p><div aria-labelledby="radix-:rg:" class="!duration-500 overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:h-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" id="radix-:rh:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 1027.21875px; --radix-accordion-content-height: 400px;"><div class="prose px-4 pb-8"><p>Applicants who meet a score of at least 20 in any English but do not meet the requirement for Mathematics can alternatively complete EDMTH1000 Introduction to Technical Mathematics unit offered by the Federation University Australia Pathways program prior to admission into the degree.</p><p>Admission pathways for applicants without a year 12 qualification</p><p>1.Completion of a Diploma of Engineering (Higher Education) at Federation University Australia</p><p>2.Completion of a cognate certificate IV in engineering in addition to a pathway mathematics unit “Introduction to Technical Maths” by Federation University Australia’s Foundation Access Studies (FAST) course</p><p>3.Completion of a cognate Diploma or Advanced Diploma in Engineering at a TAFE provider</p><p>4.Completion of Federation University Australia’s Foundation Access Studies (FAST) course</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>',
