ualifications prescribed above.</li></ul><h4>English language requirements</h4><p>Academic IELTS of 6.5 overall with no band less than 6.0; or equivalent</p></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div class="border-b border-neutral-300" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><p class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open" style="font-weight:bold;"></p><div aria-labelledby="radix-:r1n:" class="!duration-500 overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:h-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open" id="radix-:r1o:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-width: 1027.21875px; --radix-accordion-content-height: 436px;"><div class="prose px-4 pb-8"><p>If you’re an international student currently studying VCE in Australia, <a href="https://vtac.edu.au/">apply through VTAC</a>. If not, <a href="/link/10824d0d12ea4f57b870ef14178aad8b.aspx">find out how to apply directly to Federation University.</a></p><p>If you’re applying for a higher degree by research, make sure you <a href="/link/6efc37a41dd7457187d53a39c3475ba6.aspx">follow these instructions</a>.</p><p>Ready to fill out your application? You might need these codes:</p> <dl><dt>Direct application</dt><dd>Yes</dd><dt>Federation University code</dt><dd>PZ0</dd><dt><abbr title="Commonwealth Register of Institutions and Courses for Overseas Students">CRICOS</abbr> code</dt><dd>119291G</dd></dl></div></div></div></div></div></section>',
