UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<div class="wysiwyg prose line-clamp-14 overflow-hidden"><div><p>Digital technology continues to drive innovation in our society, and this includes how it impacts business processes and best practice in the accounting sector. Through this degree you’ll gain advanced skills and experience in areas including accounting, economics, finance, digital finance, digital business transformation, financial management, taxation, corporations law, management accounting, auditing, ethics and more. The course also includes industry-based experience through co-operative industry placement.</p></div><div><p style="font-weight:bold;">IT requirements</p><p>To do this course you’ll need a fast and reliable computer and access to high-speed internet. Expect to use about 5GB of data per month for every unit you’re doing. Find out more about the <a href="https://www.federation.edu.au/students/get-started/minimum-it-requirements/">minimum IT requirements</a> for studying with us.</p><h4>Got questions?</h4><p>Call us on 1800 333 864, start a live chat or <a href="https://www.federation.edu.au/contact/">submit an enquiry</a>.</p><h4>Student support</h4><p>The support we offer is second to none. Need academic help? No problem. Extra access or financial assistance? Let’s see what we can do. <a href="https://www.federation.edu.au/study/why-federation/support/">View our student services</a>.</p><h4>The fine print</h4><p>The commencement of all courses is subject to available funding and enrolment quotas.</p><p>Everything in this course overview is correct at the time of being published. However, the University reserves the right to alter any course, procedure or fee. Please check for changes before you apply or enrol.</p><p>Federation University uses Victorian and Commonwealth Government funding (for eligible students) to deliver training.</p><h4>School department</h4><p>Business</p><h4>Course co-ordinator</h4><p>Christine Peacock</p></div></div>',
    total_course_duration = '3 years full-time or part-time equivalent360 credit points = 3.0',
    offshore_tuition_fee = '39600',
    entry_requirements = '<section class="accordionContainerBlock py-12 lg:py-16 !pt-6 lg:!pt-12 !pb-4 lg:!pb-8" data-blk="AccordionContainerBlock" id="entry-requirement"><div class="container mx-auto"><p class="fs-5xl mb-8 font-semibold text-primary" style="font-weight:bold;"><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">Entry requirements</p></p><div data-orientation="vertical"><div class="border-b border-neutral-300" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><p class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" style="font-weight:bold;"></p><div aria-labelledby="radix-:ra:" class="!duration-500 overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:h-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" id="radix-:rb:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 1027.21875px; --radix-accordion-content-height: 252px;"><div class="prose px-4 pb-8"><h4>Academic entry requirements</h4><p>Successful completion of Australian Year 12, or overseas equivalent</p><h4>English language requirements</h4><p>Overall IELTS band score of 6.0, with no less than 6.0 or equivalent</p></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div class="border-b border-neutral-300" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><p class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open" style="font-weight:bold;"></p><div aria-labelledby="radix-:rc:" class="!duration-500 overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:h-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open" id="radix-:rd:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-width: 1027.21875px; --radix-accordion-content-height: 436px;"><div class="prose px-4 pb-8"><p>If you’re an international student currently studying VCE in Australia, <a href="https://vtac.edu.au/">apply through VTAC</a>. If not, <a href="/link/10824d0d12ea4f57b870ef14178aad8b.aspx">find out how to apply directly to Federation University.</a></p><p>If you’re applying for a higher degree by research, make sure you <a href="/link/6efc37a41dd7457187d53a39c3475ba6.aspx">follow these instructions</a>.</p><p>Ready to fill out your application? You might need these codes:</p> <dl><dt>Direct application</dt><dd>Yes</dd><dt>Federation University code</dt><dd>BK5</dd><dt><abbr title="Commonwealth Register of Institutions and Courses for Overseas Students">CRICOS</abbr> code</dt><dd>116436H</dd></dl></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div class="border-b border-neutral-300" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><p class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" style="font-weight:bold;"></p><div aria-labelledby="radix-:re:" class="!duration-500 overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down data-[state=closed]:h-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" id="radix-:rf:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 1027.21875px; --radix-accordion-content-height: 76px;"><div class="prose px-4 pb-8"><p>GB1 Diploma of Business</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>',
